  "solution": "Ta có\n\t\t<ul class=\"\"><li><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><munder><mo>lim</mo><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>→</mo><msup><mn>7</mn><mo>−</mo></msup></mrow></munder><mi>f</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><munder><mo>lim</mo><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>→</mo><msup><mn>7</mn><mo>−</mo></msup></mrow></munder><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>7</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mo>+</mo><mi>∞</mi></mrow></semantics></math>; <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><munder><mo>lim</mo><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>→</mo><msup><mn>7</mn><mo>+</mo></msup></mrow></munder><mi>f</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><munder><mo>lim</mo><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>→</mo><msup><mn>7</mn><mo>+</mo></msup></mrow></munder><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>7</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mo>+</mo><mi>∞</mi><mo>⇒</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>7</mn></mrow></semantics></math> là đường tiệm cận đứng của đồ thị hàm số.</li><li><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><munder><mo>lim</mo><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>→</mo><mo>+</mo><mi>∞</mi></mrow></munder><mi>f</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><munder><mo>lim</mo><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>→</mo><mo>+</mo><mi>∞</mi></mrow></munder><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>7</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>⇒</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></semantics></math> là đường tiệm cận ngang của đồ thị hàm số.</li></ul>\n\t\tMà đồ thị hàm số <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>7</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></semantics></math> có tâm đối xứng là <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi>I</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>;</mo><mi>b</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></mrow></semantics></math> nên <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mi>I</mi></semantics></math> chính là giao điểm của đường tiệm cận đứng <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>7</mn></mrow></semantics></math> và đường tiệm cận ngang <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>\n\t\tDo đó <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi>I</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>7</mn><mo>;</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>3</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></mrow></semantics></math>, suy ra <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>7</mn></mrow></semantics></math> và <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>\n\t\tVậy <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>a</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>4</mn><m